# Data Cleaning – Nashville Housing

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on cleaning and transforming Nashville housing data using SQL Server to make the dataset more consistent and suitable for analysis.

## 🧹 Data Cleaning Tasks

- Standardized the SaleDate format
- Populated missing property addresses
- Split property addresses into separate address and city columns
- Split owner addresses into address, city, and state
- Standardized SoldAsVacant values
- Identified and removed duplicate records
- Removed unused columns

## 🛠️ SQL Skills Used

- Data Type Conversion
- Joins
- String Functions
- CASE Statements
- ISNULL
- PARSENAME
- ROW_NUMBER()
- CTEs
- ALTER TABLE
- UPDATE and DELETE

## 📁 Files

- Data Cleaning Portfolio Project Queries.sql – SQL queries used for data cleaning
- Nashville Housing Data for Data Cleaning.xlsx – Dataset used for the project
